        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1939-04-07/pdf/FR-1939-04-07.pdf"
      },
      "text": "1. Item 8 is amended by inserting after\nthe words,\n“Renewal of an American passport_$5.00\nExceptions—\nSame as respects issue of passports\nif bearer of passport has status\nheld by him at time of issue of\npassport.”,\nthe following:\n“Issuance of Chinese certificate_$10.00.”"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1571,
      "char_start": 1317,
