        "page_or_item": "4 FR 1475, PDF pages 3-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "8139e7c859e04c77055190b20ddab8690453ce08eba46d86d328ee75cca7f09e",
        "signing_date": "1939-04-04",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_8078.recheck.txt",
        "text_sha256": "25c39d2da537ce95fe9dad3b211241b6e55a0d4b2e3fc50c79dd9a8994640718",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1939-04-07/pdf/FR-1939-04-07.pdf"
      },
      "text": "2. Item 9 is amended by inserting be­\nfore the words,\n“Transit certificate”,\nthe following :_\n“Limited entry certificate:\nPreparation of application and\nadministering of oath_______No fee\nGranting of limited entry cer­\ntificate____________________No fee”"
    },
